======================================================================
  Architecture Diagram: Phase 78 - Metadata vs Blob Storage Separation
======================================================================

1. Simplest Baseline Architecture:
----------------------------------------------------------------------
   Storing file metadata and bytes inside the same storage engine.

   [Client] ──▶ [Application Server] ──▶ [Primary Datastore]


2. Scaled / Resilient Architecture:
----------------------------------------------------------------------
   Relational DB: `(file_id, user_id, size, s3_key, created_at)` + S3: `s3://bucket/s3_key`.

                               ┌──▶ [Worker Node A] ──┬──▶ [Cache]
[Client] ──▶ [Load Balancer] ──┼──▶ [Worker Node B] ──┤
                               └──▶ [Worker Node C] ──┴──▶ [Primary DB] ──▶ [Replicas]
                                         │
                                         ▼
                                   [Event Queue] ──▶ [Async Workers]

======================================================================
